  "title": "Delivery Receipt Form",
  "subtitle": "Distribution Delivery Receipt: captures actual activity and handoff.",
  "description": "Delivery Receipt Form covers purchase-order shipment, handling unit, seal, receiving dock, and custody transfer. The receiving lead records Distribution Delivery Receipt activity, quantities, variance, and handoff. Delivery Receipt Form keeps Distribution Delivery Receipt exceptions visible until the receiving lead handoff.",
  "use_case": "Use Delivery Receipt Form at origin, destination dock, staging zone, and receiving location. Document purchase-order shipment, handling unit, seal, receiving dock, and custody transfer identity before Distribution Delivery Receipt begins. Compare purchase-order shipment, handling unit, seal, receiving dock, and custody transfer findings with stated Distribution Delivery Receipt criteria; route unresolved Distribution Delivery Receipt issues to distribution operations reviewer.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
